{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38905","headline":"投宣谕张侍郎乱後遇毘陵 · 杜荀鹤","name":"投宣谕张侍郎乱後遇毘陵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此生今日似前生，重着麻衣特地行。\n经乱後囊新卷轴，出山来见旧公卿。\n雨笼蛬壁吟灯影，风触蝉枝噪浪声。\n闻道中兴重人物，不妨西去马蹄轻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38905.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38905","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}